{"id": "1536994758461751456", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "You’re gonna struggle if you run a team of E0 in Arc 2… Without certain Enlightenments on Thais and Horla, you lack Vuln and Weakness, and Acceleration. Horla wanting E1, and Thais E2. Doresain himself is *weird* due to his Exalt being his main damage source and scaling off of *missing hp* so you want to Ult and STR stack quite often. His Enlightenments(I want to say), are pretty meh and comes down to his supports carrying him(althought E2 would be nice…). Main issue comes down to team being bare bones thou. Arc 2 requires Soulforge levels, and I’m not quite sure if you want to max Soulforge on E0 Awakeners. \n\nOther then that, you can do D-Tide with him. There are some interesting ways to clear with him, and if I iirc, its W3 that he likes, or W1.\n\n-# someone else can add further input, as there are others who are much more knowledgable then me <:Mkeeper_flop:1356083604236800030>", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T07:08:26.399000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["715024008462073906"], "reply_to": "1536915828371492894"}
